{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231100","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1423110001:0":{"text":"The mine's safe now. Guess you can finally go in and start working, huh?","source_cn":"矿洞里现在安全了，可以下矿干活了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB4B7D4AE895702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423110002:0":{"text":"Um, well...","source_cn":"这、这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E75C2553965734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423110003:0":{"text":"Let me be honest with you, Hyla!","source_cn":"海拉，实话跟你说了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EADD7457991B73E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423110004:0":{"text":"The truth is, we've considered joining Ironbeard for some time! We're just sticking around a little longer to weigh our options.","source_cn":"其实俺们几个早就想去铁须那边了……只不过想先观察观察情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26FBECD830355C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423110005:0":{"text":"More and more of our peers are leaving. We have to think about our future, you know?","source_cn":"眼看这边的人越来越少，不成气候，铁须那边的人越来越多，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42A5B6805F53E830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423110006:0":{"text":"Just say it—you want to quit, don't you?","source_cn":"直接点说，你们不想干了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4268496918BEB8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423110007:0":{"text":"I wish I could do this more pleasantly, but you're right.","source_cn":"俺不想说这么直接……可话说得难听点，就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A014D9C0E27309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1423110007":{"text":"I wish I could do this more pleasantly, but you're right.","source_cn":"俺不想说这么直接……可话说得难听点，就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A014D9C0E27309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423110008:0":{"text":"No, we think it's a good idea.","source_cn":"俺们赞成啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1726751B569D8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423110009:0":{"text":"But our support alone won't make a difference!","source_cn":"可俺们赞成有啥用呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37974DEC05D28117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423110010:0":{"text":"All the skilled folks are working for Ironbeard now! We only do grunt work here.","source_cn":"村里的技术好手都在铁须那边，俺们只能干点体力活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB3E7FA8B526388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423110011:0":{"text":"Everyone would stay if the arcane steel technology were ready by now!","source_cn":"要是这魔钢现在就能研究出来，那大伙自然都不会走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA205B57E08EAD23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423110016:0":{"text":"Looks like the biggest issue lies with Ironbeard.","source_cn":"看来最大的问题还是在铁须那边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC120F0FCB419BCF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423110017:0":{"text":"You know what Ironbeard's up to while we're stuck here? He's busy throwing a farewell feast for his scouts!","source_cn":"就瞧现在，咱这边冷冷清清的，几个人干所有的活，铁须那边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3EB8566E5C14616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423110018:0":{"text":"Who'd want to stay here when there are delicious treats and a fun party waiting somewhere else?","source_cn":"比起待在这，俺们肯定更想去宴会吃点喝点，凑凑热闹啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x065B06BF96FB5E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423110019:0":{"text":"A farewell feast?","source_cn":"铁须在办欢送宴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3E632837F381C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1423110020:0":{"text":"I heard he's sending some scouts to survey a vein in a mountain, and he'll be sending more to other places as well.","source_cn":"好像是要派一批工匠去考察一处矿山的矿脉，后面还要派好几...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97102CAC26580B9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1423110020":{"text":"I heard he's sending some scouts to survey a vein in a mountain, and he'll be sending more to other places as well.","source_cn":"好像是要派一批工匠去考察一处矿山的矿脉，后面还要派好几批人去不同地方考察呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97102CAC26580B9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1423110021:0":{"text":"...We must stop him!","source_cn":"……我们得去阻止他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FC929AD231374C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"We'll be even more shorthanded.","source_cn":"村里的人力会短缺得更严重","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xABC88EBB0D0CB2AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We'll be even more shorthanded.","female":"We'll be even more shorthanded.","variant_male_record_index":"74110","variant_female_record_index":"74111","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"We'll be losing more craftsmen.","source_cn":"村里的工匠会大量流失","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AEB346E43E37AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We'll be losing more craftsmen.","female":"We'll be losing more craftsmen.","variant_male_record_index":"74112","variant_female_record_index":"74113","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Are you against the research?","source_cn":"你们不赞成魔钢研究？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x33AD5B285062B821","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you against the research?","female":"Are you against the research?","variant_male_record_index":"74106","variant_female_record_index":"74107","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1423110012:0":{"text":"Of course, I want restore my village its former glory!","source_cn":"当然想啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B62998A6696EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423110013:0":{"text":"But we can't pull it off with so few of us.","source_cn":"可这不是俺们几个人能办到的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A7C1D6FEA08189","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1423110014:0":{"text":"All this talk about arcane steel, but where's the proof? When's it actually happening?","source_cn":"像你们说的要研究魔钢拯救村子，这不是还没影吗？谁知道什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE4C70EB82333B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1423110015:0":{"text":"The best craftsmen are all with Ironbeard. What if the research takes years, or even decades, to complete? Are we supposed to just sit around and wait?","source_cn":"最好的工匠都在铁须那边，咱们这边就剩这么几个人，要是得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B10756A90C0AEC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"What about the village?","source_cn":"你们不想拯救村子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x752FA5D817D0A3CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What about the village?","female":"What about the village?","variant_male_record_index":"74108","variant_female_record_index":"74109","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:海拉":{"text":"Hyla","source":"海拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:怠惰的矮人":{"text":"Lazy Dwarf","source":"怠惰的矮人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":27,"speaker_count":2}}